{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10350030","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10350030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1035003001:1":{"text":"마침 그 이야기를 하고 있었어요...","source_cn":"我们正在谈这事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8FDA4410D3A0D8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035003002:1":{"text":"이미르 현자가 여길 지나가는 걸 봤어요. 어머니는 그가 다친 것 같다고 하셨죠.","source_cn":"我们看到伊米尔贤者经过这里，母亲还说，看到贤者受伤了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0940899BB500EA2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035003003:1":{"text":"그래서 도와드리려고 불렀는데, 부르는 소리가 안 들렸던 건지... 쳐다도 안 보고 그냥 가시더라고요.","source_cn":"可当我们呼唤贤者时，他却像是听不见……头都没歪一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C749F6BE7CD4DF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1035003004:1":{"text":"정말이지... 아무리 대현자라고 해도 이건 너무 경우가 없네!","source_cn":"真没礼貌……就算他是大贤者，我也很不服气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE488793804CD9BAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1035003005:1":{"text":"그런 거 아니에요, 어머니. 얼마 전에도 현자가 직접 이곳 상황을 살피러 왔었잖아요. 분명 우리 걱정을 많이 하고 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"不会的，贤者前阵子还在附近视察过情况，明明很关心我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B80D80F380543D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民卡弗拉":{"text":"카펠라","source":"村民卡弗拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村民芙拉兹莉":{"text":"프라즐리","source":"村民芙拉兹莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}